>  My third question is: How ofen can I pray before my God says, 
>"Enough already!  No more free stomach filling for you!" ?
>(ie, does Prayer stop working at any point?)

Yes in a way. Prayer stops working when you use it too much. Everytime you
pray there is a counter called the prayer timeout that gets reset. If you
pray again before it counts back down to zero, then your god gets mad and
stops listening to your prayer requests until you do something to appease
them.

>Finally, what exactly does a Ring of Warning do?  I'm wearing one

DON'T! Rings suck up food. It's making you hungry twice as fast. Take it
off immediately!

> (I'm 
>not sure where it came from.  I think I may've started with it.) and it 
>doesn't seem to be warning me about anything.  This could be a good 
